{
  "//": [
    "Type checking for the script-tag-composed parts of the site.",
    "",
    "checkJs is ON for assets/ \u2014 47 of 81 files pass it today. The rest are",
    "today. The rest are listed in `exclude` below: that array is a DEBT",
    "REGISTER, not a config. It may only ever shrink. Because include/ is",
    "broad and exclude/ is explicit, a NEW file is type-checked by default and",
    "has to be clean to land.",
    "",
    "Run: npm run typecheck   (wired into npm run validate)",
    "",
    "Most excluded files fail on the same two things: window.* handles (fixed",
    "for the whole site by types/globals.d.ts) and getElementById() returning",
    "HTMLElement where the code wants .value/.checked/.href. The second is",
    "fixed per-site with a JSDoc cast, e.g.",
    "  /** @type {HTMLInputElement} */ (document.getElementById('curr-search'))",
    "and each fix removes a line from `exclude`."
  ],
  "compilerOptions": {
    "allowJs": true,
    "checkJs": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "strict": false,
    "target": "ES2022",
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "lib": [
      "ES2022",
      "DOM",
      "DOM.Iterable"
    ],
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "types": []
  },
  "include": [
    "types/globals.d.ts",
    "assets/**/*.js"
  ],
  "exclude": [
    "**/vendor/**",
    "**/*.min.js",
    "assets/adaptive-engine.js",
    "assets/ai-tutor.js",
    "assets/app.js",
    "assets/canvas-bridge.js",
    "assets/canvas-code-ui.js",
    "assets/convince-skeptic.js",
    "assets/curriculum-enhancements.js",
    "assets/curriculum-guided-path.js",
    "assets/curriculum-lesson-merge.js",
    "assets/curriculum-product-upgrades.js",
    "assets/curriculum-sidebar.js",
    "assets/curriculum-student-launch.js",
    "assets/edge-tuned-twins.js",
    "assets/edupulse-bridge.js",
    "assets/family-letter.js",
    "assets/futures-tutor.js",
    "assets/game-access.js",
    "assets/game-fx.js",
    "assets/game-hint-ladder.js",
    "assets/game-juice.js",
    "assets/game-score.js",
    "assets/learning-supports/learning-supports.js",
    "assets/learning-supports/supports-adaptations.js",
    "assets/lesson-a11y.js",
    "assets/lesson-juice.js",
    "assets/lesson-platform.js",
    "assets/lesson-shell-guard.js",
    "assets/lesson-telemetry.js",
    "assets/level3/checker.js",
    "assets/level3/workspace.js",
    "assets/nt-activity-kit.js",
    "assets/nt-page-enhance.js",
    "assets/nt-usage.js",
    "assets/reasoning-replay.js"
  ]
}